NAME
       tee - copy standard input to files and standard output

SYNOPSIS
       tee [-ai] [file ...]

DESCRIPTION
       Reads standard input and writes it both to standard output and
       to each FILE, so a pipeline can be tapped without interrupting
       it.

OPTIONS
       -a     append to the files instead of truncating them
       -i     accepted and ignored, for portability

EXAMPLES
       dmesg | tee /mnt/boot.log | grep hda

SEE ALSO
       cat(1)
